"type":"text","text":"Filter-Id envelope, placement rank), and its profile is the typed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"axiam-radius-reply\/1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record a decision renders. Every write is conditional on the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"version"},{"type":"text","text":" the caller read and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passes the server’s write gate. The tenant’s Session-Timeout cap is one more row of it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(get_policy, replace_policy): lowering it is always allowed, raising it is allowed and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"audited. The decision route FreeRADIUS calls is not in this registry."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/networkapi","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"NetworkApi"}]}}}